    zeno.mint(msg.sender, amount);
    emit ZENOPurchased(msg.sender, amount, price);
}
```

Look at two things - `getPrice()` and `whenActive` modifier:

```Solidity
modifier whenActive() {
    require(block.timestamp > state.startTime, "Auction not started");
